        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F60CEN, Modern Century Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Schlage made handleset has stylish square mounts on the outside. Available in an array of stylish finishes, the Century Handleset is exemplary of quality. When you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. The Century Handleset features a rugged all-metal chassis and a solid brass construction for security. This modern handleset is ANSI Grade 1 security rated. Primarily used on front doors, this single cylinder handleset is key operated on the exterior and by a turn knob on the interior. The latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/century-dummy-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f93cen\"><b>Century Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Century Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Trim: Handlesets are solid forged brass; wrought brass trim rings with concealed security inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim: are zinc-based plated to match finishes indicated.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Century Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 17-13/16\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-1/2\" to 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 11-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-CEN-hand-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262151\"><b>Schlage Century Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish. The Georgian Knob is not available in Satin Chrome. The Andover Knob is not available in Matte Black. The Flair Lever is not available in Matte Black.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Century Single Cylinder Handleset, Schlage F60CEN",
                "description": "Schlage F60CEN Century Single Cylinder Handleset - This Schlage made handleset has stylish square mounts on the outside. Available in 5 finishes, the Century Handleset is exemplary of quality. When you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. The Century Handleset features a rugged all-metal chassis and a solid brass construction for security. This modern handleset is ANSI Grade 1 security rated. Primarily used on front doors, this single cylinder handleset is key operated on the exterior and by a turn knob on the interior. The latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.",
                "keywords": "SCH-F60CEN, schlage f60cen century single cylinder handlesets, front door locks, schlage f-series handlesets, schlage f360 century handlesets single cylinder, SCH-F360, sch-f60, schlage f series century handlesets, square handlesets, elegant door handles, solid brass door handles, solid brass handlesets, schlage century handlesets, century schlage single cylinder handlesets, Schlage f60 century single cylinder handle sets,"
